# 7. File Validation

Before parsing business transactions:

* Verify file completeness.
* Validate file naming conventions.
* Validate file size.
* Calculate cryptographic checksum.
* Detect duplicate file.
* Validate NACHA structure.
* Validate file header.
* Validate batch headers.
* Validate batch control records.
* Validate file control records.
* Validate control totals.
* Validate record counts.
* Validate hash/control values where applicable.
* Validate expected origin/source information.

Invalid files must be quarantined or moved to an appropriate failure location.

Do not silently discard invalid files.

