# 9. Large File Processing

Support very large ACH/NACHA files.

Do not load the complete file into memory.

Use streaming processing.

The file should be read sequentially while batches are identified.

The architecture should support:

* Large files
* Millions of payment records
* Constant/bounded memory usage
* Backpressure
* Configurable batch size
* Parallel batch processing
* Controlled concurrency

