# 22. Outgoing File Handling

The response file must be written safely.

Never expose a partially written response file to the external vendor.

Prefer:

Temporary file

→ Complete write

→ Validate size/checksum

→ Atomic rename/move

→ Final outbound file name

The response file lifecycle must be recorded.

Archive the final response file and maintain checksum information.

