# Failure Recovery

Recover at the batch level.

Never reread successfully completed batches.

Recovery should support:

* Parser restart
* Worker restart
* Kafka outage
* Reservation service outage
* Vendor acknowledgement delay

Unpublished Outbox events remain in the database until successfully delivered.

