# High-Level Business State Machine

```text
FILE_RECEIVED
        │
        ▼
FILE_VALIDATED
        │
        ▼
PAYMENTS_PARSED
        │
        ▼
RESERVE_REQUESTED
        │
        ▼
FUNDS_EARMARKED
        │
        ▼
VENDOR_RESPONSE_SENT
        │
        ▼
VENDOR_ACK_RECEIVED
        │
        ▼
RESERVATION_CONFIRMED
        │
        ▼
COMPLETED
```

If any reservation fails, that payment reaches a terminal failure state while other payments continue processing independently. The response file includes both successful and failed reservation results, allowing the vendor to reconcile each request.

This workflow separates **technical processing** (parsing, persistence, messaging) from the **business lifecycle** (request → earmark → response → acknowledgement → reservation confirmation), resulting in a resilient, auditable, and scalable pre-fund reservation platform suitable for multi-instance, dual-data-center deployment.
